          ],
          "benefits_md": "The scheme provides a subsidy for the construction of fish retail markets, including ornamental fish or aquarium markets. The project cost is ₹1,00,00,000/- per unit.\n**The subsidy provided is:**\n\n- 40% of the project cost is for beneficiaries belonging to the General Category.\n- 60% of the project cost is for beneficiaries belonging to the Scheduled Caste (SC) or Women categories.\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme aims to support the construction of fish retail markets, including those for ornamental fish and aquariums. Through this scheme, financial assistance for project costs is provided to individual beneficiaries.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "The scheme \"Pradhan Mantri Matasya Sampada Yojana: Construction of Fish Retail Markets including Ornamental Fish/Aquarium Markets\" by the Ministry Of Fisheries, Animal Husbandry & Dairying, Government of India, aims to support the construction of fish retail markets, including those for ornamental fish and aquariums. Through this scheme, financial assistance for project costs is provided to individual beneficiaries."
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "type": "paragraph"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme &quot;Pradhan Mantri Matasya Sampada Yojana: Construction of Fish Retail Markets including Ornamental Fish/Aquarium Markets&quot; by the Ministry Of Fisheries, Animal Husbandry &amp; Dairying, Government of India, aims to support the construction of fish retail markets, including those for ornamental fish and aquariums. Through this scheme, financial assistance for project costs is provided to individual beneficiaries.\n<br>\n\n",
